            <div xml:id="m-c870ea90-fc3e-43e8-a433-cc3fcf655e3e">
              <lg xml:id="m-90afb7cd-bcb2-4deb-9b7f-a14fac4c4080">
                <l xml:id="m-0c14ac18-4f99-4cb4-a215-82b5c1131d6c" facs="#m-8be72ecc-bb13-47aa-bc90-b57f379a3ffb" label="ambiguous">1064</l><l xml:id="m-3b12ff69-4bf5-4c0f-ba57-c4a1a8a6b43e" facs="#m-2f179d29-ad49-4e01-84ab-0e8da848fb44" label="text-like">20th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-25109c5c-ea8a-44c0-bb13-b65fd42fdb94" facs="#m-b05dbacb-69ed-4821-a96c-e608fe708729" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-1fbdf943-25fc-452a-8ca2-833476342e73" facs="#m-2a5475ff-b855-4e1b-8981-8b84dd49e564" label="lyrics-like">Argire, quaésumus Dómine, fi-[ómnibus mundéntur offénsis, *et</l><l xml:id="m-51047cc0-ea3b-4b18-b32a-8b2dd41fc9ef" facs="#m-193b929d-fc4f-4f34-961d-4d4373dd32e3" label="lyrics-like">I délibus tuis indulgéntiam pla-l secúra tibi mente desérviant. Per</l><l xml:id="m-184c098c-4711-4dce-96cd-fb3b0df606fc" facs="#m-74d6e61a-e80f-4d79-be15-5d472e8ff64d" label="lyrics-like">cátus et pacem:t ut páriter ab!l Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4b0ae3b0-1a45-4841-bede-0099c76a4935" facs="#m-612d0817-4f67-475e-9422-c9ab15d36021" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-0a238693-87f0-4cd0-923f-bfbb3e2359e9" facs="#m-f39e6b3b-376e-4c49-9b62-2aa44e3948ca" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Ephesios. Ephes. 5. d.</l><l xml:id="m-e62456d0-7973-49db-b876-d43fe41501b7" facs="#m-65d64307-2a3b-43c6-af37-4b7b781fb5c7" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Vidéte quómodo caute !Sancto, loquéntes vobismetípsis in</l><l xml:id="m-9efeb84c-fc58-4949-86d2-d44f8cc82457" facs="#m-8443ddab-d4a1-4c5a-aa85-4b92dfd1365d" label="lyrics-like">ambulétis: non quasi insipién-] psalmis, et hymnis, et cánticis spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e43d68db-1d4f-46c4-88e7-dab25ac6ae2e" facs="#m-249f34c1-81a0-4c3c-b74f-af4cd63041a8" label="lyrics-like">rituálibus, cantántes, et psalléntes</l><l xml:id="m-14c7fd00-05f2-4c67-99d7-27e240f0c0f5" facs="#m-a7dd2050-577a-40ef-845f-9c92431fb96a" label="lyrics-like">tes, sed ut sapiéntes, rediméntes</l><l xml:id="m-fdf1024f-300b-4dba-921d-6ef77dccd8e2" facs="#m-96445b34-7457-4e83-b98b-773cb4ae0f3f" label="lyrics-like">in córdibus vestris Dóminõ : grátias</l><l xml:id="m-045d7050-7d3c-4893-9c8d-98b9f6d18938" facs="#m-791ef4fb-0c83-48b8-9d0d-bd1a2c9338a4" label="lyrics-like">tempus, quóniam dies mali sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-f16a7439-48d4-40dc-b504-b4bbd7c9022a" facs="#m-592f353f-4cf9-4dd2-b494-e0564549c8ad" label="lyrics-like">Proptérea nolite fieri imprudéntes,</l><l xml:id="m-f314e7f5-65b9-4e11-8f36-0b1a5e772d44" facs="#m-87249378-f97b-43cf-8ced-93910674d2d9" label="lyrics-like">agéntes semper pro ómnibus, in</l><l xml:id="m-1464e33c-0c19-4d04-85a4-bd0f56858ba6" facs="#m-3ff61e6f-f210-4aed-a326-202d813022bd" label="lyrics-like">nómine Dómini nostri Jesu Christi,</l><l xml:id="m-0dc249cf-26f0-472f-a26b-ceef9d9f78e3" facs="#m-3808437f-ef5f-421c-8e66-d3f6392f9790" label="lyrics-like">sed intelligéntes, quae sit volúntas</l><l xml:id="m-7809e533-3a54-476a-90d2-a7ab6c4e2cd0" facs="#m-15a264e3-4288-47c4-a8fc-113035414c94" label="lyrics-like">Dei. Et nolite inebriári vino, in quo Deo et Patri. Subjécti invicem in</l><l xml:id="m-0a9d0466-7c8b-4e1a-8b03-5d81e21e61c8" facs="#m-8397d8cf-a0e6-4c01-8ba3-07a7b825bdde" label="lyrics-like">est luxúria: sed implémini Spiritu  timóre Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-ad4a8248-ae1b-4a4f-bdb7-50ab9ee0ecf6" facs="#m-aa3bca28-29f5-48f6-9a7b-0a4f52d1e611" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Oculi ómnium. p. 944.</l><l xml:id="m-652dbb4e-e13e-4502-9c0e-cbdb5dbc2884" facs="#m-abe0be6e-f85f-4cd5-9aac-1af6637e750c" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-f2a7f570-c252-4f4d-a7bc-0db72b47e3ca" facs="#m-351953fd-8f5e-4a68-b37f-f5191a500921" label="lyrics-like">HLle-lú-—</l><l xml:id="m-fe1df736-2b43-43bf-a25d-ebcb31a3980d" facs="#m-a1a53920-5e15-479c-91d2-93a2f29a48f4" label="lyrics-like">v. Pa- rá-tum cor mé¬ um, Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d479c088-dfca-4d0b-936b-da1461872cec" facs="#m-43163161-cd14-4dff-abb6-d8222faa6b6e" labe